# Interaction Atlas MCP Server — Environment Variables
#
# Credentials (don't rotate — safe in env vars):
# CLIENT_ID=your-client-id
# CLIENT_SECRET=your-client-secret
#
# Tokens are managed by the TokenStore (file/KV/D1) — NOT env vars.
# Run `pnpm auth` for first-time OAuth setup.
#
# For API key auth, set:
# API_KEY=your-api-key

# Optional multi-account map (Worker env binding or process.env):
# API_KEYS="key1:account-a,key2:account-b"
